{"5135920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Stash", "steam_appid": 5135920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5180750], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scarce essential has two values: what a desperate customer will pay for it — and what it could do for you after dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN THE SHOP BY HAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order stock, carry the crates in from the supplier's truck, and place every item on the shelf yourself. Set your own prices, then work the register and close the sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/extras/2f3f035d3029979544577b8cff7514c1.poster.avif?t=1787899801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/extras/2f3f035d3029979544577b8cff7514c1.webm?t=1787899801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/extras/2f3f035d3029979544577b8cff7514c1.mp4?t=1787899801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SELL — OR SURVIVE THE NIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gas, batteries, water, food and medicine sell well. They're also what keeps the bunker under your shop warm, lit and stocked. When the shutters close, you live on what you didn't sell — and hunger, thirst and freezing nights are all waiting for one bad call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/extras/aa64085e50eeb8dfc161b916c458f8e3.poster.avif?t=1787899801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/extras/aa64085e50eeb8dfc161b916c458f8e3.webm?t=1787899801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/extras/aa64085e50eeb8dfc161b916c458f8e3.mp4?t=1787899801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LISTEN TO THE RADIO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The radio is your only source of news — and it runs on batteries. Droughts, fuel crises, incoming storms — if it moves the market, you hear it on the radio first. Listen closely and you stock up before the crisis hits; miss it, and yesterday's profit becomes today's shortage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FILL THE CONTRACTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers pin order lists to the contract board. Gather what they ask for and deliver it — in return you get paid, and you receive parts you won't find anywhere else. Those parts unlock new systems for your shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REBUILD THE LAST STASH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair the workbench and start crafting scarce goods like medkits yourself. Keep the generator running, install new shelves — bring the shop back piece by piece. And that covered bench in the corner... its turn will come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can sell everything. Surviving the night is another matter.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scarce essential has two values: what a desperate customer will pay for it — and what it could do for you after dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN THE SHOP BY HAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order stock, carry the crates in from the supplier's truck, and place every item on the shelf yourself. Set your own prices, then work the register and close the sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/extras/2f3f035d3029979544577b8cff7514c1.poster.avif?t=1787899801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/extras/2f3f035d3029979544577b8cff7514c1.webm?t=1787899801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/extras/2f3f035d3029979544577b8cff7514c1.mp4?t=1787899801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SELL — OR SURVIVE THE NIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gas, batteries, water, food and medicine sell well. They're also what keeps the bunker under your shop warm, lit and stocked. When the shutters close, you live on what you didn't sell — and hunger, thirst and freezing nights are all waiting for one bad call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/extras/aa64085e50eeb8dfc161b916c458f8e3.poster.avif?t=1787899801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/extras/aa64085e50eeb8dfc161b916c458f8e3.webm?t=1787899801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/extras/aa64085e50eeb8dfc161b916c458f8e3.mp4?t=1787899801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LISTEN TO THE RADIO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The radio is your only source of news — and it runs on batteries. Droughts, fuel crises, incoming storms — if it moves the market, you hear it on the radio first. Listen closely and you stock up before the crisis hits; miss it, and yesterday's profit becomes today's shortage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FILL THE CONTRACTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers pin order lists to the contract board. Gather what they ask for and deliver it — in return you get paid, and you receive parts you won't find anywhere else. Those parts unlock new systems for your shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REBUILD THE LAST STASH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair the workbench and start crafting scarce goods like medkits yourself. Keep the generator running, install new shelves — bring the shop back piece by piece. And that covered bench in the corner... its turn will come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can sell everything. Surviving the night is another matter.</p>", "short_description": "Run the last shop of a post-apocalyptic town. Stock shelves by hand, price scarce goods, fill contracts — and haul what you don't sell down to your bunker, because surviving the night is the other half of the job.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Czech, Portuguese - Brazil, Romanian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/55da38f2a8b4a7e452a180e9dc2ea2e64eb1fc1b/header.jpg?t=1787899801", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/e38e47f994768686e2c5be35372a26b53a68f645/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787899801", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135920/e38e47f994768686e2c5be35372a26b53a68f645/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787899801", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 (3 GB) / Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:<